    {
      "id": "section_3",
      "title": "The Explorer's Tool: Logarithms (1.5 min)",
      "lecture_lines": [
        "Logarithms find the time exponent.",
        "Think of a treasure map.",
        "Log_b(y) = x finds steps.",
        "10^3 = 1000 means log_10(1000) = 3.",
        "You need 3 rocket stages."
